# "Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose an instant or sorcery card from it": when the hand holds only lands and a
# creature there is nothing eligible to choose, so nothing is discarded (CR 701.20b-c, the hand is still revealed), and
# Bot2 keeps all of its cards (the Forest in its graveyard is its turn-2 discard to hand size).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Collective Brutality
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Collective Brutality.Cast
Bot1.Modes(1)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Forest
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.Graveyard = Collective Brutality
